        "geometry": "Fire Claws: single-target melee claw strike at adjacent enemy (point footprint). Fire Claws adds fire damage to each claw hit. Werewolf form increases attack speed. Fire Claws capped at 7 frames in Werewolf form (6 with Thresher)."
