      "payload_json": {
        "loop": "Shapeshift into Werewolf form (form-locked). Cast Armageddon for body-attached fire meteor aura. Attack enemies with Fire Claws melee strikes (fire-enhanced claw hits). Use Feral Rage for life leech buff charges before switching to Fire Claws burst."
